import{_ as a,o as i,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 141 | Realm Refinement · Dao Integration Realm | Predatory Faction vs. Symbiotic Faction","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 141 | Realm Refinement · Dao Integration Realm | Predatory Faction vs. Symbiotic Faction","no":141,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Dao Integration Realm","Predatory Faction","Symbiotic Faction","System Comparison"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0141_模块1-合道境-掠夺派vs共生派对比.md","filePath":"en/0141_模块1-合道境-掠夺派vs共生派对比.md"}'),o={name:"en/0141_模块1-合道境-掠夺派vs共生派对比.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,h){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-141-dao-integration-realm-predatory-faction-vs-symbiotic-faction-detailed-comparison" tabindex="-1">Entry 141 | Dao Integration Realm: Predatory Faction vs. Symbiotic Faction Detailed Comparison <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-141-dao-integration-realm-predatory-faction-vs-symbiotic-faction-detailed-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 141 | Dao Integration Realm: Predatory Faction vs. Symbiotic Faction Detailed Comparison&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 04, 01, 14</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-is-dao-integration-swallowing-the-cosmos-or-embracing-it" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Is Dao integration swallowing the cosmos or embracing it <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-is-dao-integration-swallowing-the-cosmos-or-embracing-it" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Is Dao integration swallowing the cosmos or embracing it&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Dao Realm (Entry 134) competed over &quot;establishing hegemony or fairness&quot;; Dao Integration competes over the mortal apex&#39;s most fundamental thing — is Dao integration ultimately &quot;I swallow the cosmos&quot; or &quot;I embrace the cosmos&quot;? The Predatory faction&#39;s Dao integration is swallowing: swallowing cosmic origin into one&#39;s own body, claiming supremacy; the Symbiotic faction&#39;s Dao integration is embracing: merging one&#39;s own Dao into origin, lifting Myriad Ranks up together. The same &quot;heaven-human unity,&quot; different paths, and the endpoint of the five mortal-cultivation realms is worlds apart.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the watershed of the two paths: the anti-predation axiom — swallowing is predatory increment, embracing is symbiotic increment; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — the Symbiotic sees Myriad Races as fellow cultivators, the Predatory sees all beings as nourishment; the collective ascension axiom — embracing integrates for ascension, swallowing integrates for monopoly, eliminating talent underuse; the causal self-discipline axiom — all embracing operations are reportable and traceable; the law-first axiom — the Dao Integration comparison framework is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-systematic-comparison-table" tabindex="-1">I. Systematic Comparison Table <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-systematic-comparison-table" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Systematic Comparison Table&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Predatory · Dao Integration</th><th>Symbiotic · Dao Integration</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Dao integration nature</td><td>Swallowing cosmic origin, claiming supremacy</td><td>Embracing origin, lifting Myriad Ranks up</td></tr><tr><td>Domain form</td><td>Domain hegemony, swallowing others&#39; domains</td><td>Domain symbiosis, harmoniously coexisting with public laws</td></tr><tr><td>Breakthrough purpose</td><td>Ascending alone, overriding Myriad Races</td><td>Myriad Races republican co-building, selfless Dao</td></tr><tr><td>Breakthrough cost</td><td>Swallowing accumulates resentment, hazards erupt entirely</td><td>Real cost + anchor escort, reversible</td></tr><tr><td>Destination</td><td>Efficiency ceiling: ascending alone is civilizational regression</td><td>Collective ascension, directly entering the sacred Boundary-Breaking Realm</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-the-three-fallacies-peak-in-dao-integration" tabindex="-1">II. The Three Fallacies Peak in Dao Integration <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-three-fallacies-peak-in-dao-integration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Three Fallacies Peak in Dao Integration&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Document 04&#39;s three fallacies peak in this realm:</p><ol><li>Cosmological fallacy: treating cosmic origin as private property, Dao integration is swallowing</li><li>Ethical fallacy: taking Myriad Races as nourishment, ascending alone</li><li>Efficiency fallacy: believing swallowing is fastest — swallowed resentment erupts entirely when the swallower falls, civilization must regress</li></ol><h2 id="iii-enlightened-predators-benevolent-swallowing-is-still-swallowing" tabindex="-1">III. Enlightened Predators: Benevolent Swallowing Is Still Swallowing <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-enlightened-predators-benevolent-swallowing-is-still-swallowing" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Enlightened Predators: Benevolent Swallowing Is Still Swallowing&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Enlightened predators,&quot; even if benevolent, their Dao integration is still swallowing — he is willing to ascend with those around him, but never lifts Myriad Ranks together; instead he treats Myriad Races as &quot;portable nourishment.&quot; He stands atop the predatory system, and the ceiling of ascending alone is his ceiling.</p><h2 id="iv-why-the-predatory-faction-must-historically-regress" tabindex="-1">IV. Why the Predatory Faction Must Historically Regress <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-why-the-predatory-faction-must-historically-regress" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Why the Predatory Faction Must Historically Regress&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory Dao integrator ascends alone: while he lives, he suppresses Myriad Races by himself; when he ascends/falls, no one upholds Myriad Races, civilization regresses. This is precisely what the collective ascension axiom aims to eradicate: &quot;the strongman ascending alone.&quot; The Symbiotic Dao integrator lifts Myriad Ranks up together: when the grandmaster falls, the symbiotic network still upholds Myriad Ranks — this is the ultimate structural answer to eradicating historical regression.</p><h2 id="v-the-righteous-rogue-the-dao-integration-meaning-of-embrace" tabindex="-1">V. The Righteous Rogue: The Dao Integration Meaning of Embrace <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-the-righteous-rogue-the-dao-integration-meaning-of-embrace" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. The Righteous Rogue: The Dao Integration Meaning of Embrace&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Lin Hao&#39;s deduction of Path D · Humanoid Artificial Dao-Rule Soul Rings is essentially tearing up old law at the Dao-integration layer: replacing swallowing hunting-and-stripping with symbiotic artificial Dao rules. One who chooses to embrace Myriad Races in Dao Integration is already closer to hyper-multiverse civilization than the enlightened predator trapped atop swallowing — the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm.</p><h2 id="vi-cross-realm-handover-the-sacred-divide-between-ascending-alone-and-lifting-myriad-ranks" tabindex="-1">VI. Cross-Realm Handover: The Sacred Divide Between Ascending Alone and Lifting Myriad Ranks <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-cross-realm-handover-the-sacred-divide-between-ascending-alone-and-lifting-myriad-ranks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Cross-Realm Handover: The Sacred Divide Between Ascending Alone and Lifting Myriad Ranks&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory chooses to ascend alone in Dao Integration; the Symbiotic chooses to lift Myriad Ranks up; this divergence reaches its endpoint at the Boundary-Breaking Realm breakthrough. The one who ascends alone enters sacred cultivation, behind him a civilization that no one upholds and will eventually regress; the one who lifts Myriad Ranks enters sacred cultivation, behind him a Myriad Races republic advancing as a whole and ascending perpetually. This is the final reckoning of the two paths at the mortal endpoint: the Predatory pours every effort and wins the individual, but loses civilization; the Symbiotic seemingly yields the individual&#39;s monopolized glory, but wins the eternal future of the whole advancing toward the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm. The five mortal-cultivation realms are complete here; the answer needs no more words.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: the Predatory faction wastes cosmic-level talent on ascending alone; the Symbiotic faction invests talent in upholding Myriad Races</li><li>Anti-predation: cutting off &quot;swallowing origin&quot; at the mortal apex, the path divide reaches its endpoint</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: Tang-Luo-style &quot;universal welfare&quot; is still swallowing-style solitary ascension, beings depend on it; symbiotic Myriad Races republican co-building</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: the Predatory sees Myriad Races as nourishment, the Symbiotic sees Myriad Races as fellow cultivators; 99% coverage has no exceptions</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: the Predatory swallows everything; the Symbiotic pushes the selfless Dao into sacred cultivation from Dao Integration onward</li></ul><p>The final comparison between ascending alone and lifting Myriad Ranks deserves one more cut: the Predatory&#39;s solitary ascension essentially bears all of Myriad Races&#39; causality on one person; seemingly great, actually fragile — once he cannot bear it, Myriad Races have no successor system. The Symbiotic lifting Myriad Ranks seemingly yields the individual&#39;s monopolized glory, but actually turns ascension into a perpetually operating network. The former&#39;s endpoint is the lonely &quot;ceiling&quot; of a solitary overlord; the latter&#39;s direction is the endless Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm. The answer was already written in the first step of the two paths.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The two paths in Dao Integration compete not over who integrates higher, but whether after integration they still bring Myriad Ranks. The Predatory pours every effort to swallow origin and ascend alone, only to find behind him a civilizational wasteland no one upholds; the Symbiotic steadily embraces origin, lifting Myriad Ranks up together. Is Dao integration swallowing or embracing — the answer to this question determines whether the endpoint of the five mortal-cultivation realms is a historical cycle, or the true starting point toward the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm.</p><p>In the final analysis, the Dao Integration Predatory vs. Symbiotic comparison described in this document is no isolated case — it operates within Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s overall coordinates; its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a> · <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const u=a(o,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,u as default};
